---
import HomeLayout from '@/layouts/Home.astro';

const lastUpdated = "October 17, 2026";
---

<HomeLayout 
  title="Terms of Service — Pabitra Mohan Singh" 
  description="Terms of service and usage guidelines for pabitramohansingh.com."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    
    <header class="mb-12 border-b border-neutral-200 pb-8 dark:border-neutral-800">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>
    </header>

    <article class="space-y-10 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using this website (the "Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, you must discontinue use of the Site immediately. These Terms apply to all visitors, users, and any other persons who access or use the Site.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Site is operated by an individual based in India ("the Owner," "I," "me," or "my"). The Site is a static personal portfolio built with Astro and hosted on Cloudflare Workers. It showcases software projects, technical writing, professional information, and links to external code repositories and potential sponsorship platforms. The Site does not offer user accounts, login systems, paid subscriptions, direct transactions, or interactive comment sections.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">2. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <p>
          All content made available through the Site, including but not limited to the visual design, layout, custom source code, written text, documentation, graphics, and images, is the exclusive property of the Owner and is protected by the Copyright Act, 1957 (India), the Berne Convention, and other applicable intellectual property laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          Without limiting the foregoing, the Owner expressly reserves all rights in and to any original illustrations, SVG graphics, icons, diagrams, and visual assets created for or incorporated into the Site. You may not reproduce, distribute, publicly display, modify, create derivative works from, or otherwise exploit any such illustrations or SVG assets without the prior written consent of the Owner.
        </p>
        <p>
          You are granted a limited, revocable, non-exclusive license to view the Site and its content for personal, non-commercial informational purposes only. This license does not transfer any title, ownership, or intellectual property rights to you and is automatically revoked upon any breach of these Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">3. Open Source Exemption for Linked Repositories</h2>
        <p>
          The Site contains links to external code repositories, including repositories hosted on GitHub. These Terms apply solely to the Site itself and to the content hosted directly on the Site.
        </p>
        <p>
          Any source code, documentation, or other materials made available through an external repository are governed exclusively by the open-source license applicable to that repository (for example, the MIT License or the GNU General Public License) and by the terms of service of the platform hosting the repository. Nothing in these Terms restricts, modifies, or overrides any rights granted to you under an applicable open-source license. You must independently review and comply with the license terms of any external repository you access through a link on the Site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">4. Prohibited Activities</h2>
        <p>You agree not to engage in any of the following activities in connection with the Site:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Use any robot, spider, crawler, scraper, offline reader, or other automated or manual process to access, monitor, extract, copy, harvest, or mine data or content from the Site without the Owner's prior written consent.</li>
          <li>Use the Site or its content for the development, training, or improvement of any artificial intelligence or machine learning model, unless such use is expressly permitted by the Site's <code>robots.txt</code> file or by separate written authorization from the Owner.</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the Site, its hosting infrastructure, or any connected systems or networks.</li>
          <li>Probe, scan, or test the vulnerability of the Site or any related system, or breach or circumvent any security or authentication measures.</li>
          <li>Engage in any denial-of-service attack, distributed denial-of-service attack, or any other activity that interferes with or disrupts the Site's operation or availability.</li>
          <li>Use the Site in any manner that violates applicable laws or regulations or infringes the rights of any third party.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Conditional permission is granted to the operators of public search engines to use spiders to copy materials from the Site solely for the purpose of creating publicly available searchable indices, provided such activity is consistent with the Site's <code>robots.txt</code> directives.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
