        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">7. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless the Owner from and against any and all claims, liabilities, damages, losses, costs, and expenses (including reasonable legal fees) arising out of or in any way connected with your breach of these Terms, your misuse of the Site or any content made available through the Site, or your violation of any applicable law or the rights of any third party in connection with your use of the Site.
        </p>
        <p>
          The Owner reserves the right to assume the exclusive defense and control of any matter otherwise subject to indemnification by you, in which event you agree to cooperate fully with the Owner in asserting any available defenses.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
