        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">12. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          Questions regarding these Terms may be directed to:
        </p>
        <p class="font-medium text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">
          <a href="mailto:support@pabitramohansingh.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline dark:text-blue-400">
            support@pabitramohansingh.com
